# The title's sheets (Scores, Achievements, How to play, Settings with the
# erase confirmation), the Challenge list, then the Daily round with the
# pause sheet and Leave round.
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click Scores
until 60 No scores yet.
frames 10
save scores
click Done
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click Achievements
until 60 Crystal Clear
frames 10
save achievements
click Done
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click Help
until 60 The well
frames 10
click Done
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click Settings
until 60 Hold/drag to dig
frames 10
click Erase local progress
until 30 Erase all local progress
frames 10
save settings-erase
click Cancel
frames 10
click Done
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Challenge
until 60 Shovel-Rationed
frames 10
save challenges
key Escape 2
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Daily
until 120 Release
frames 60
save daily
key Escape 2
until 60 Leave round
frames 10
click Leave round
until 120 Round abandoned.
frames 10
save daily-left
